{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05275","headline":"奉和幸韦嗣立山庄侍燕应制 · 赵彦昭","name":"奉和幸韦嗣立山庄侍燕应制","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"贤族唯题里，儒门但署乡。\n何如表岩洞，宸翰发辉光。\n地在兹山曲，家临合水阳。\n六龙驻旌罕，四牡耀旗常。\n北斗临台座，东山入庙堂。\n天高羽翼近，主圣股肱良。\n野竹池亭气，村花涧谷香。\n纵然怀豹隐，空愧蹑鵷行。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"赵彦昭","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_05275.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05275","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}